{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"card":1,"entry":2,"missions":34,"alongside":39,"kin":44,"engines":69,"usedOn":70,"sites":71,"crewed":76,"museums":77,"hero":78},null,{"id":3,"name":4,"category":5,"agency":6,"country":7,"manufacturer":8,"first_flight":9,"status":10,"era":11,"epoch":12,"best_known_for":13,"credit":14,"links":15,"linked_missions":28,"linked_sites":29,"tagline":32,"description":33},"opportunity","Opportunity (MER-B)","rover","NASA","USA","NASA JPL","2004-01-25","RETIRED","1981-2011","iss-assembly","Spirit的孪生探测器；约15年、45 km火星作业","Skeleton entry for /fleet (PRD-012 v0.2 / Phase A scaffold). Builder + agency + first-flight per public sources. Specs and gallery TBD in later phases.",[16,20,24],{"l":17,"u":18,"t":19},"Opportunity (rover) — Wikipedia","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Opportunity_(rover)","intro",{"l":21,"u":22,"t":23},"Mars Exploration Rover — NASA","https://mars.nasa.gov/mer/","core",{"l":25,"u":26,"t":27},"MER mission profile (NASA NTRS)","https://mars.nasa.gov/mer/mission/overview/","deep",[3],[30],{"type":31,"site_id":3},"mars","Spirit的孪生探测器；在火星上运行近15年","Opportunity（MER-B）是美国NASA JPL制造的行星探测车。是Spirit的孪生探测器；在火星上运作了近15年。创下45.16 km的地外行驶纪录，并发现了表明火星过去存在水的赤铁矿“蓝莓”。2019年停用。",[35],{"id":3,"name":36,"first":37,"year":38},"Opportunity","保持火星车行驶里程纪录（45.16 km）直到2026年10月被Perseverance超越；在火星表面工作14年，而设计寿命仅90个火星日",2003,[40],{"id":41,"name":42,"tagline":43},"delta-ii","Delta II","NASA的中型行星科学主力火箭——1989-2018年共155次飞行",[45,49,53,57,61,65],{"id":46,"name":47,"tagline":48},"spirit","Spirit (MER-A)","火星探测漫游车;运作6年",{"id":50,"name":51,"tagline":52},"sojourner","Sojourner","火星漫游车；Pathfinder任务",{"id":54,"name":55,"tagline":56},"curiosity","Curiosity (MSL)","核动力火星科学实验室火星车",{"id":58,"name":59,"tagline":60},"perseverance","Perseverance（Mars 2020）","携带Ingenuity直升机；火星样品封存",{"id":62,"name":63,"tagline":64},"lrv-apollo","月球车","首次载人月球车；Apollo 15、16、17",{"id":66,"name":67,"tagline":68},"promise","PROMISE","NASA 为月球南极拟议的月球车",[],[],[72],{"type":31,"href":73,"name":36,"place":74,"text":75},"/mars/opportunity","子午线高原","火星探测漫游车B——马拉松漫游车。5,111个火星日的活跃运作（超过14年），行驶45.16 km（这是任何其他天体上的车辆创造的最大行驶距离，直到2026年10月被Perseverance超越）。在Endurance、Victoria和Endeavour陨石坑证实了过去的液态水。在2018年最后的沙尘暴期间，漫游车的最后一条遥测数据显示电力耗尽——这一时刻被诗意地解释为\"我的电池电量很低，天色已晚\"。",[],[],"/orrery/images/fleet-galleries/opportunity/04.webp"],"uses":{"params":["id"]}}]}
